// The arena run (Enter at the title): 20 timed waves through five arenas. Enemies keep coming in from the
// edges all through a wave (their spawn point shows `warn` seconds first); what they drop are shards,
// both money and XP. Between waves, a shop: each player's own.
//
// duration, spawnRate (enemies a second), maxAlive (at once): [the first wave's, the last wave's],
// in between they grow evenly. More with more players: coopScale per extra player. healthGrowth:
// enemies have that much more health with each wave (0.08: 8%).
// pools: who comes, from wave `from` to wave `to`, picked by weight among the ones open.
// eliteFrom, eliteChance: from that wave on, that chance an enemy comes as an elite (tougher, harder
// hitting, three times the shards). eliteAffixes: how many affixes (affixes.json) an elite comes with, from each
// `from` wave on (Blazing, Guardian, Volatile...: each changes how it fights). bosses: wave -> boss; that wave lasts until it falls. bossCoopHealth:
// a boss's health goes up this much for each player past the first (0.75: x1.75 for two, x2.5 for three).
// xp: shards to level 2, and how many more for each level after.
// start: the weapon in hand, what is owned (weapons, weapon skills) and the spells (spells/*.json) the
// run starts with; chooseSpell: the first spells each player may pick among, after the weapon; chooseCount: how many of
// them each player is offered, at random each run (of different elements while it can; 0: all). Players make no spells in a run: level ups give them. As a wave ends, after
// `intermission` s, each level up offers levelChoices picks: a spell not had yet (while one of the
// three spell keys is free), a technique of levelSkills for the weapon in hand not had yet, or the
// next level of one had (or of the weapon in hand). One of the picks is always a next level (a branch
// choice shows all its branches), the others new ones while there are new ones left; then all are
// next levels. levelRerolls, levelBanishes: each player's free rerolls of a level up's picks for the whole run,
// and banishes (a pick taken out of the level ups for the rest of the run, another one in its place). Levels never run out: after a spell's or technique's written "levels", at
// `branchLevel` it takes one of its "branches" (the player picks), and every level past those adds
// `mastery`. Then the presents, then the shop.
// presents: an elite may leave one (chance), at most perWave a wave; each is a free pick among
// `choices` shop items, made after the level ups.
// shop: offers a time (stat and tag items of upgrades.json, each of a rarity: its numbers times
// `power`, its price times `price`, how often by `weight` [at the first wave, at the last]; and the
// unlocks not owned yet, for their price: a mod's, the base run sells none). priceScale: every price
// times this, [at the first wave, at the last]. coopPrice: every player gets every shard picked up, so
// every price (the reroll's too) goes up this much per player past the first. interest: shards kept
// through a shop grow as the prices do by the next one, so what could be bought then still can.
// weaponPrice: what a weapon not in unlocks sells for (every mod's weapons are in the shop). The reroll's price (reroll, + rerollStep each time in a shop, + 1 every 2 waves).
// levelChoices: picks offered for a level up.
// spawnScale: the spawn rate and the most at once times this; coopScale: half again for each player
// past the first (0.5).
// shardFalloff: the players' greed items add up with diminishing returns: a total t of extra shard chance
// counts as t / (1 + shardFalloff x t) (0.5: +20% stays about +18%, +100% gives +67%, +300% gives +120%).
// damageFalloff: extra damage from items (stat items together, then tag items and mastery together) counts
// whole up to `from`, past that each bit less: e past `from` counts as e / (1 + rate x e). With from 0.4
// and rate 0.6: +40% stays +40%, +100% gives +84%, +200% gives +122%, +400% gives +154%, never past +207%.
// Score: each enemy's "score" for the kill (twice for an elite), waveScore times the wave's number
// for getting through it, victoryScore for the last one.
// arenas: the arena of each stretch of waves (arenas/*.json: see arenas/pit.json), each from its
// wave on; resetEachWave builds it anew before each wave. ("arena": one written in, as arena.json.)
// chooseWeapon: each player picks a weapon before the first wave (start.weapon is in hand until then),
// and none are for sale: the shop sells the skills of the weapon in hand instead.
// duel: in multiplayer, after the last wave, a final duel: the arena anew, everyone back up and in a
// ring `radius` m from the centre of its arena (duel.arena: "" fights it in the last wave's), `countdown` s with no harm done, then everyone for themselves, one life
// each. The last one standing wins; after `duration` s, the one with the most of their health left.
// difficulties: the levels a run is played at, the easiest first. The first is open; winning one opens
// the next. waves: the run's first this many waves (the run still ramps up over all 20, so a short level
// stops partway up). health, damage: enemies' times this. healthGrowth: their health grows this much more
// each wave (on top of the run's), damageGrowth: their damage grows this much each wave. spawn: the spawn
// rate and the most at once times this. eliteChance: added to the run's.
{
    "waves": 20,
    "duration": [45, 90],
    "spawnRate": [0.4, 1.8],
    "maxAlive": [5, 22],
    "healthGrowth": 0.08,
    "warn": 1.2,
    "eliteFrom": 7,
    "eliteChance": 0.08,
    "eliteAffixes": [{ "from": 7, "count": 1 }, { "from": 15, "count": 2 }],
    "spawnScale": 0.75,
    "coopScale": 0.5,
    "pickupRange": 3.5,
    "shardFalloff": 0.5,
    "damageFalloff": { "from": 0.4, "rate": 0.6 },
    "bossCoopHealth": 0.75,
    "resetEachWave": true,
    "chooseWeapon": true,
    "duel": { "enabled": true, "duration": 120, "countdown": 3, "radius": 9, "arena": "crucible" },

    "pools": [
        { "enemy": "slime",   "from": 1,  "to": 6, "weight": 4 },
        { "enemy": "slime",   "from": 7,  "weight": 1.5 },
        { "enemy": "skulker", "from": 3,  "weight": 3 },
        { "enemy": "archer",  "from": 4,  "weight": 1.2 },
        { "enemy": "brute",   "from": 6,  "weight": 1 },
        { "enemy": "brute",   "from": 12, "weight": 1 },
        { "enemy": "archer",  "from": 14, "weight": 0.8 },

        // Each arena after the Pit brings its own: the Stockade's sappers, the Gorge's menders, the Icefall's
        // rimecallers, the Quarry's golems. They stay on after it, rarer
        { "enemy": "sapper",     "from": 5,  "to": 8, "weight": 1.6 },
        { "enemy": "sapper",     "from": 9,  "weight": 0.6 },
        { "enemy": "mender",     "from": 9,  "to": 12, "weight": 0.8 },
        { "enemy": "mender",     "from": 13, "weight": 0.5 },
        { "enemy": "rimecaller", "from": 13, "to": 16, "weight": 1.2 },
        { "enemy": "rimecaller", "from": 17, "weight": 0.6 },
        { "enemy": "golem",      "from": 17, "weight": 0.9 }
    ],
    "bosses": { "10": "chieftain", "20": "warden" },

    "xp": { "base": 10, "step": 3 },
    "start": { "weapon": "sword", "owned": [], "spells": [],
               "chooseSpell": ["firebolt", "frostbolt", "spark", "fireball", "twin_embers", "ice_shards", "frost_nova", "glacier", "chain_lightning", "thunderclap"],
               "chooseCount": 3 },
    "levelRerolls": 3,
    "levelBanishes": 3,
    "levelSkills": ["leap_slam", "whirlwind", "shadow_dash", "backflip", "volley", "disengage", "sanctuary", "radiance", "harvest", "grim_vault"],
    "intermission": 2.5,
    "branchLevel": 5,
    "mastery": { "damage": 0.1, "cooldown": 0.03 },
    "presents": { "chance": 0.35, "perWave": 3, "choices": 3 },
    "shop": {
        "slots": 4,
        "reroll": 2,
        "rerollStep": 2,
        "priceScale": [0.5, 1.5],
        "coopPrice": 0.5,
        "interest": true,
        "levelChoices": 3,
        "unlocks": {},
        "rarities": [
            { "name": "Common",    "power": 1.0, "price": 1.0, "weight": [70, 30] },
            { "name": "Rare",      "power": 1.5, "price": 1.4, "weight": [24, 38] },
            { "name": "Epic",      "power": 2.1, "price": 1.9, "weight": [5, 22] },
            { "name": "Legendary", "power": 3.0, "price": 2.6, "weight": [1, 10] }
        ]
    },

    "difficulties": [
        { "name": "Normal",    "waves": 10 },
        { "name": "Hard",      "waves": 13, "health": 1.15, "damage": 1.1,  "healthGrowth": 0.01, "spawn": 1.05, "eliteChance": 0.02 },
        { "name": "Very hard", "waves": 16, "health": 1.3,  "damage": 1.2,  "healthGrowth": 0.02, "damageGrowth": 0.01, "spawn": 1.1, "eliteChance": 0.04 },
        { "name": "Nightmare", "waves": 20, "health": 1.5,  "damage": 1.3,  "healthGrowth": 0.03, "damageGrowth": 0.015, "spawn": 1.15, "eliteChance": 0.06 },
        { "name": "Torment",   "waves": 20, "health": 1.8,  "damage": 1.45, "healthGrowth": 0.04, "damageGrowth": 0.02, "spawn": 1.25, "eliteChance": 0.09 },
        { "name": "Hell",      "waves": 20, "health": 2.2,  "damage": 1.6,  "healthGrowth": 0.05, "damageGrowth": 0.025, "spawn": 1.35, "eliteChance": 0.12 }
    ],

    "waveScore": 50,
    "victoryScore": 2000,

    // Where the waves are fought: each arena (arenas/*.json) from its wave on. A new one is built as
    // its first wave starts, everyone at its spawn point; the duel has its own.
    "arenas": [
        { "arena": "pit",      "from": 1 },
        { "arena": "stockade", "from": 5 },
        { "arena": "gorge",    "from": 9 },
        { "arena": "icefall",  "from": 13 },
        { "arena": "quarry",   "from": 17 }
    ]
}
